    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if hearing some kind of call, the six former companions returned to their hometown, a mountain covered with red leaves. Here, they will explore the familiar yet strange past, approach the hidden truth, and face the secrets buried in each other's hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a CTB turn-based battle mode game developed by an individual. In addition to combat strategies and equipment drive, freely exploring the game world and encountering stories, events and puzzles everywhere will also be the core experience of this game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Story === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years after the end of the Kerrigan War, rumors of mutations and demons came from the hometown called Red Leaf Mountains, which has been guarded by the goddess of the mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six former partners returned to their hometown at the same time. Whether it is the chess game of the gods or the entanglement of various forces, they will uncover the truth of a past hidden in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/c2b9d6a92657506cfd2592bab75d3232.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Exploration === </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average 30-60 hours of immersive experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 side stories or rumors </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary items and collections obtained accidentally </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More hidden puzzles and huge mazes </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of this world is waiting for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/fc5d70d6617ddfdce1059bedb9ab539d.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Battle === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich weapons and magic skills, survival and tactical abilities, bonded combat skills, formation effects and special techniques gained from exploring the world, making turn-based battles against dangerous enemies with different characteristics full of the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/bc6eadb6715705ba643561041238c98c.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Equipment === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random equipment, attributes, inlay and enchantment system, match them to create your own tactical choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/ff949e96c88f5a46e04338026ed07389.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=235 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Art === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character portraits and background music are all drawn and produced by an individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Although not refined enough, I hope they can help you get deeper into this world.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As if hearing some kind of call, the six former companions returned to their hometown, a mountain covered with red leaves. Here, they will explore the familiar yet strange past, approach the hidden truth, and face the secrets buried in each other's hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a CTB turn-based battle mode game developed by an individual. In addition to combat strategies and equipment drive, freely exploring the game world and encountering stories, events and puzzles everywhere will also be the core experience of this game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Story === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two years after the end of the Kerrigan War, rumors of mutations and demons came from the hometown called Red Leaf Mountains, which has been guarded by the goddess of the mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six former partners returned to their hometown at the same time. Whether it is the chess game of the gods or the entanglement of various forces, they will uncover the truth of a past hidden in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/c2b9d6a92657506cfd2592bab75d3232.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Exploration === </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average 30-60 hours of immersive experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 100 side stories or rumors </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Legendary items and collections obtained accidentally </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More hidden puzzles and huge mazes </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner of this world is waiting for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/fc5d70d6617ddfdce1059bedb9ab539d.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Battle === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich weapons and magic skills, survival and tactical abilities, bonded combat skills, formation effects and special techniques gained from exploring the world, making turn-based battles against dangerous enemies with different characteristics full of the unexpected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/bc6eadb6715705ba643561041238c98c.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=246 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Equipment === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random equipment, attributes, inlay and enchantment system, match them to create your own tactical choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836980/extras/ff949e96c88f5a46e04338026ed07389.avif?t=1753459965\" width=616 height=235 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >=== Art === </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character portraits and background music are all drawn and produced by an individual.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Although not refined enough, I hope they can help you get deeper into this world.</p>",
